<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1839368228"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:05.689"><div begin="14.043" end="44.023" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="14.043" end="20.578" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="14.043" end="15.833">幸福</span><span begin="15.833" end="16.825">吗</span> <span begin="17.099" end="17.370">两</span><span begin="17.370" end="17.889">颗心</span><span begin="17.889" end="18.289">背</span><span begin="18.289" end="18.588">对</span><span begin="18.588" end="19.593">背挣</span><span begin="19.593" end="20.578">扎</span></p><p begin="21.183" end="27.357" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="21.183" end="22.837">快乐</span><span begin="22.837" end="23.710">吗</span> <span begin="24.124" end="24.352">还</span><span begin="24.352" end="24.792">是我</span><span begin="24.792" end="25.263">们</span><span begin="25.263" end="25.540">都</span><span begin="25.540" end="26.332">在装</span><span begin="26.332" end="27.357">傻</span></p><p begin="28.000" end="36.370" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="28.000" end="28.341">掩</span><span begin="28.341" end="30.012">饰伤</span><span begin="30.012" end="31.034">疤</span> <span begin="31.176" end="31.452">告</span><span begin="31.452" end="31.904">诉我</span><span begin="31.904" end="32.364">这</span><span begin="32.364" end="32.603">样</span><span begin="32.603" end="33.677">算是</span><span begin="33.677" end="35.424">爱</span><span begin="35.424" end="36.370">吗</span></p><p begin="37.099" end="44.023" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="37.099" end="37.578">抱</span><span begin="37.578" end="37.945">紧</span><span begin="37.945" end="39.461">你</span> <span begin="40.082" end="40.272">能</span><span begin="40.272" end="40.744">否磨</span><span begin="40.744" end="41.174">掉</span><span begin="41.174" end="41.569">心</span><span begin="41.569" end="42.246">的</span><span begin="42.437" end="43.417">距</span><span begin="43.417" end="44.023">离</span></p></div><div begin="44.144" end="1:13.736" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="44.144" end="50.623" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="44.144" end="45.854">算了</span><span begin="45.854" end="46.849">吗</span> <span begin="47.146" end="47.423">要</span><span begin="47.423" end="47.799">不要</span><span begin="47.799" end="48.314">说</span><span begin="48.314" end="48.528">一</span><span begin="48.528" end="49.073">说</span><span begin="49.073" end="49.739">实</span><span begin="49.739" end="50.623">话</span></p><p begin="51.228" end="57.385" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="51.228" end="52.792">逃避</span><span begin="52.792" end="53.673">是</span><span begin="54.143" end="54.463">另</span><span begin="54.463" end="54.839">一种</span><span begin="54.839" end="55.310">沉</span><span begin="55.310" end="55.607">默</span><span begin="55.607" end="56.369">的摩</span><span begin="56.369" end="57.385">擦</span></p><p begin="57.986" end="1:05.056" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="57.986" end="58.393">是</span><span begin="58.393" end="59.877">我太</span><span begin="59.877" end="1:01.017">傻</span> <span begin="1:01.246" end="1:01.532">以</span><span begin="1:01.532" end="1:01.981">为让</span><span begin="1:01.981" end="1:02.302">步</span><span begin="1:02.302" end="1:02.631">是</span><span begin="1:02.631" end="1:03.230">最</span><span begin="1:03.230" end="1:03.651">好</span><span begin="1:03.651" end="1:04.478">办</span><span begin="1:04.478" end="1:05.056">法</span></p><p begin="1:05.191" end="1:13.736" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="1:05.191" end="1:05.487">无</span><span begin="1:05.487" end="1:05.922">法</span><span begin="1:05.922" end="1:06.270">消</span><span begin="1:06.270" end="1:08.089">化</span><span begin="1:08.680" end="1:08.941">两</span><span begin="1:08.941" end="1:09.350">个</span><span begin="1:09.350" end="1:09.690">世</span><span begin="1:09.690" end="1:10.325">界</span><span begin="1:10.325" end="1:10.717">的</span><span begin="1:10.717" end="1:11.978">落</span><span begin="1:11.978" end="1:13.736">差</span></p></div><div begin="1:14.096" end="1:42.251" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:14.096" end="1:19.297" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="1:14.096" end="1:15.071">有些</span><span begin="1:15.071" end="1:15.966">失落</span> <span begin="1:15.966" end="1:16.463">怎</span><span begin="1:16.463" end="1:16.670">么</span><span begin="1:16.670" end="1:17.586">说出</span><span begin="1:17.586" end="1:19.297">口</span></p><p begin="1:21.117" end="1:26.539" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="1:21.117" end="1:22.174">有些</span><span begin="1:22.174" end="1:23.044">冷漠</span> <span begin="1:23.044" end="1:23.474">让</span><span begin="1:23.474" end="1:23.734">爱</span><span begin="1:23.734" end="1:24.099">太</span><span begin="1:24.099" end="1:24.971">折</span><span begin="1:24.971" end="1:26.539">磨</span></p><p begin="1:27.370" end="1:34.386" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="1:27.370" end="1:27.871">不</span><span begin="1:27.871" end="1:28.970">敢</span><span begin="1:29.124" end="1:29.715">奢</span><span begin="1:29.715" end="1:30.724">求</span><span begin="1:30.892" end="1:31.457">现</span><span begin="1:31.457" end="1:32.528">在</span><span begin="1:32.750" end="1:33.236">以</span><span begin="1:33.236" end="1:34.386">后</span></p><p begin="1:34.649" end="1:38.028" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="1:34.649" end="1:34.962">明</span><span begin="1:34.962" end="1:35.393">知道</span><span begin="1:35.393" end="1:35.871">早</span><span begin="1:35.871" end="1:36.125">该</span><span begin="1:36.125" end="1:36.762">放</span><span begin="1:36.762" end="1:38.028">手</span></p><p begin="1:38.583" end="1:42.251" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="1:38.583" end="1:38.914">倔</span><span begin="1:38.914" end="1:39.357">强</span><span begin="1:39.357" end="1:39.793">的我</span><span begin="1:39.793" end="1:40.277">却</span><span begin="1:40.277" end="1:40.716">一直</span><span begin="1:40.716" end="1:41.567">回</span><span begin="1:41.567" end="1:42.251">头</span></p></div><div begin="1:42.371" end="2:13.281" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:42.371" end="1:47.333" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="1:42.371" end="1:43.356">这个</span><span begin="1:43.356" end="1:44.195">时候</span> <span begin="1:44.195" end="1:44.665">不</span><span begin="1:44.665" end="1:44.943">要</span><span begin="1:44.943" end="1:45.787">太执</span><span begin="1:45.787" end="1:47.333">着</span></p><p begin="1:49.414" end="1:54.797" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="1:49.414" end="1:50.376">这个</span><span begin="1:50.376" end="1:51.272">时候</span> <span begin="1:51.272" end="1:51.733">不</span><span begin="1:51.733" end="1:52.012">能</span><span begin="1:52.012" end="1:53.322">太温</span><span begin="1:53.322" end="1:54.797">柔</span></p><p begin="1:55.618" end="2:02.813" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="1:55.618" end="1:56.124">如</span><span begin="1:56.124" end="1:57.245">果</span><span begin="1:57.435" end="1:57.929">以</span><span begin="1:57.929" end="1:58.915">后</span> <span begin="1:59.157" end="1:59.758">再也</span><span begin="1:59.758" end="2:00.146">没有</span><span begin="2:00.146" end="2:00.549">我</span><span begin="2:00.549" end="2:00.915">们</span><span begin="2:00.915" end="2:01.480">的</span><span begin="2:01.480" end="2:01.736">以</span><span begin="2:01.736" end="2:02.813">后</span></p><p begin="2:02.896" end="2:06.231" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="2:02.896" end="2:03.195">多</span><span begin="2:03.195" end="2:03.677">希望</span><span begin="2:03.677" end="2:04.119">我</span><span begin="2:04.119" end="2:04.394">们</span><span begin="2:04.394" end="2:04.930">会</span><span begin="2:04.930" end="2:06.231">说</span></p><p begin="2:06.650" end="2:13.281" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="2:06.650" end="2:07.075">不</span><span begin="2:07.075" end="2:07.987">曾</span><span begin="2:07.987" end="2:08.683">后</span><span begin="2:08.683" end="2:09.560">悔</span><span begin="2:09.907" end="2:10.404">爱</span><span begin="2:10.404" end="2:13.281">过</span></p></div><div begin="2:24.533" end="2:40.188" itunes:songPart="Bridge"><p begin="2:24.533" end="2:31.550" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="2:24.533" end="2:24.868">我</span><span begin="2:24.868" end="2:26.391">们太</span><span begin="2:26.391" end="2:27.351">傻</span> <span begin="2:27.648" end="2:27.978">所</span><span begin="2:27.978" end="2:28.417">以会</span><span begin="2:28.417" end="2:28.838">爱</span><span begin="2:28.838" end="2:29.121">到</span><span begin="2:29.121" end="2:29.680">不</span><span begin="2:29.680" end="2:30.112">敢</span><span begin="2:30.112" end="2:30.957">放</span><span begin="2:30.957" end="2:31.550">下</span></p><p begin="2:31.602" end="2:40.188" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="2:31.602" end="2:31.978">不</span><span begin="2:31.978" end="2:32.406">觉</span><span begin="2:32.406" end="2:32.660">得</span><span begin="2:32.660" end="2:34.452">吗</span> <span begin="2:35.152" end="2:35.362">我</span><span begin="2:35.362" end="2:35.878">想</span><span begin="2:35.878" end="2:36.184">你</span><span begin="2:36.184" end="2:36.743">懂</span><span begin="2:36.743" end="2:37.067">我</span><span begin="2:37.067" end="2:38.483">的</span><span begin="2:38.483" end="2:40.188">话</span></p></div><div begin="2:40.579" end="3:08.691" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:40.579" end="2:46.038" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="2:40.579" end="2:41.554">有些</span><span begin="2:41.554" end="2:42.449">失落</span> <span begin="2:42.449" end="2:42.946">怎</span><span begin="2:42.946" end="2:43.153">么</span><span begin="2:43.153" end="2:44.069">说出</span><span begin="2:44.069" end="2:46.038">口</span></p><p begin="2:47.455" end="2:53.319" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="2:47.455" end="2:48.635">有些</span><span begin="2:48.635" end="2:49.517">冷漠</span> <span begin="2:49.517" end="2:49.929">让</span><span begin="2:49.929" end="2:50.215">爱</spa