">时候</span> <span begin="3:17.766" end="3:18.190">不</span><span begin="3:18.190" end="3:18.464">能</span><span begin="3:18.464" end="3:18.956">太</span><span begin="3:18.956" end="3:19.992">温</span><span begin="3:19.992" end="3:21.603">柔</span></p><p begin="3:22.102" end="3:30.949" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="3:22.102" end="3:22.592">如</span><span begin="3:22.592" end="3:23.769">果</span><span begin="3:23.850" end="3:24.453">最</span><span begin="3:24.453" end="3:25.345">后</span><span begin="3:25.634" end="3:26.147">终于</span><span begin="3:26.147" end="3:26.625">决定</span><span begin="3:26.625" end="3:27.030">松</span><span begin="3:27.030" end="3:27.417">开</span><span begin="3:27.417" end="3:27.697">了</span><span begin="3:27.697" end="3:28.526">双</span><span begin="3:28.526" end="3:30.949">手</span></p><p begin="3:31.540" end="3:42.553" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="3:31.540" end="3:32.314">我</span><span begin="3:32.314" end="3:32.747">们</span><span begin="3:32.747" end="3:33.267">以</span><span begin="3:33.267" end="3:34.458">后</span><span begin="3:34.703" end="3:35.039">要</span><span begin="3:35.039" end="3:35.552">找到</span><span begin="3:35.552" end="3:36.452">更</span><span begin="3:36.452" end="3:37.094">好</span><span begin="3:37.094" end="3:38.224">的</span> <span begin="3:39.435" end="3:40.052">天</span><span begin="3:40.052" end="3:42.553">空</span></p></div></body></tt>